Second chart: Specialists per-capita over time

```{r}
oecd_spec_gp_per_cap %>% 
  filter(category == 'Specialist',
         country == 'Australia') %>% 
  ggplot(aes(x = year, y = head_count_pc*100)) +
  geom_line() +
  geom_point() +
  theme_grattan() +
  grattan_y_continuous(limits = c(0,200)) +
  labs(title = "The number of specialists per person in Australia has been growing strongly",
       subtitle = "Number of specialists per 100,000 people, 2000-2022.",
       x = "",
       y = "",
       caption = "Source: National Health Workforce Data Set (2023)")
  
```

